In accordance with Section 4(b) and Section 4(d) of the Apache License 2.0,
the following upstream files were modified in this fork:

  - Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock (renamed package/binary to `velm`, updated
    repository/homepage metadata, added `crates/term-*` workspace members)
  - README.md, CHANGELOG.md (velm documentation and fork changelog)
  - crates/ghostty-vt/src/lib.rs (exposed semantic prompt/content getters)
  - src/main.rs, src/cli.rs, src/cli/{plugin,server,spec}.rs,
    src/session.rs, src/server/socket_paths.rs, src/api/{client,server}.rs,
    src/config.rs, src/config/{io,model}.rs, src/logging.rs,
    src/platform/mod.rs, src/plugin_installations.rs, src/plugin_paths.rs,
    src/product_announcements.rs, src/release_notes.rs,
    src/checksum.rs (renamed binary/app dirs/sockets/env vars to `velm` and
    silently ignored the `[term]` configuration section)
  - src/update.rs, src/detect/manifest.rs, src/detect/manifest_update.rs,
    src/noninteractive_process.rs, src/remote/attach.rs
    (removed remote update checks, self-update, GitHub plugin downloads,
    and `curl` invocation)
  - src/events.rs, src/pane.rs, src/pane/{osc,terminal}.rs,
    src/terminal/runtime.rs, src/input/keybindings.rs,
    src/app/{mod,runtime,custom_commands}.rs
    (added OSC 133 command output tracking, `term.copy_last_output`, and
    `term.explain_last`)
  - src/client/tests/mod.rs and integration tests under tests/ (updated
    assertions for `velm` naming, removed update/plugin-download behavior,
    and OSC 133 support)

